<dialog id="enquiry-dialog" aria-labelledby="enquiry-title"><button class="enquiry-close" aria-label="Close enquiry form">Close ×</button><p class="eyebrow">KINGS OF KINGS INTERNATIONAL</p><h2 id="enquiry-title">Start a conversation.</h2><p id="enquiry-context"></p><form id="enquiry-form" action="/api/enquiries" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="category"><div class="form-row"><label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required></label><label>Email address<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required></label></div><div class="form-row"><label data-phone-field>Phone <span>(optional)</span><input type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="60"></label><label data-location-field>City / country<input name="location" autocomplete="address-level2" maxlength="160"></label></div><div data-event-fields hidden><label>What would you like to do?<select name="event_intent"><option value="tour">Tour or present a show</option><option value="join">Include my act in a Kings show</option><option value="upcoming">Ask about upcoming shows</option></select></label><div class="form-row"><label>Event or act name<input name="event_name" maxlength="160"></label><label>Proposed date <span>(optional)</span><input type="date" name="event_date"></label></div><label>Venue, city and expected audience<input name="venue" maxlength="250"></label></div><div data-artist-fields hidden><label>Artist enquiry<select name="artist_intent"><option value="release">Release music through Kings of Kings Records</option><option value="book-artist">Book an existing artist</option><option value="iley-dread">Book Iley Dread</option></select></label><label>Artist / act name<input name="artist_name" maxlength="160"></label><label>Music or artist link <span>(optional)</span><input type="url" name="music_url" placeholder="https://" maxlength="1000"></label></div><label data-message-field>Tell us the details<textarea name="message" rows="5" maxlength="6000" required></textarea></label><label class="form-check" data-updates-consent><input type="checkbox" name="updates_consent" value="yes"> I want to receive the updates I selected. I can unsubscribe by replying to any update.</label><div data-giveaway-fields hidden><p>Newsletter signup includes an entry in the Upliftment giveaway when registration opens. Three winners will each receive an album copy and a T-shirt. Winners will be notified by email. Entries close January 5, 2027 at 5:00 p.m. EST (Toronto time). Void where prohibited.</p><label class="form-check"><input type="checkbox" name="age_18" value="yes"> I confirm I am 18 years of age or older.</label><label class="form-check"><input type="checkbox" name="winner_publicity" value="yes"> If I win, I agree that my name will be published online as a winner.</label></div><label class="form-check"><input type="checkbox" name="privacy_consent" value="yes" required> I agree that Kings of Kings may use these details to respond to this enquiry or manage the updates I requested. <a href="/privacy/">Privacy information</a></label><label class="form-honeypot" aria-hidden="true">Leave this empty<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label><p class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="form-preview-note">Preview: email delivery is not connected yet. You can review this form, but it will not send or register your details.</p><button class="button gold" type="submit">Review enquiry ↗</button></form></dialog>
